      "name": "S1 Multipart memory-exhaustion probing",
      "technique_id": "T1499.004",
      "technique_ref": "attack-pattern--1b0c7784-20e5-5272-a30a-d6f8e1a72463",
      "extensions": {
        "extension-definition--fb9c968a-745b-4ade-9b25-c324172197f4": {
          "extension_type": "new-sdo"
        }
      },
      "tactic_id": "TA0040",
      "description": "The attacker POSTs oversized multipart bodies to upload.php, driving the pre-RINIT parser past memory_limit. Each shot fatals \"in Unknown on line 0\" with the FPM child exiting code 70 and respawning. Evidence: php_fpm NOTICE fatals and child exits, apache_mod_php_vulnerable \"in Unknown on line 0\", nginx_access POST 200 with off-baseline response bytes.",
      "execution_start": "2026-10-21T20:44:03Z",
      "execution_end": "2026-10-21T23:22:07Z",
